'''Shiftry''' (Japanese: '''ダーテング''' ''Dirteng'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

