==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Diamond & Pearl|Shiftry|14}} from the {{TCG|Diamond & Pearl}} expansion.
*'''Nipping Cyclone''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Shiftry|97}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

